19s specially formulated Buffins for that extra pep in your step! Feeling mentally drained? Take some time out to relax at your window and just watch the world go by. Manage your physical and mental energy to get the most out of every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Decorate your space!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget worrying about your security deposit in Garland! Grow houseplants, change your wallpaper, rearrange furniture and make your apartment feel like home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf89 Live that life!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy seasonal festivals, fish, photograph wildlife, contribute to the museum or just take life one day at a time. Cities grow and change, so as development continues you\u2019ll find more things to love around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 See you in Garland!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/0abf9ddebec58a2db47fbb8af621cfb0.poster.avif?t=1768265813\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/0abf9ddebec58a2db47fbb8af621cfb0.webm?t=1768265813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/0abf9ddebec58a2db47fbb8af621cfb0.mp4?t=1768265813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1441770/extras/734bfa4020bcf22b813cca1583931a64.avif?t=1768265813\" width=800 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;3 Violet</p>","developers":["Violet LeBeaux"],"genres":[{"description":